From d5be9cfd2d444af0eb932fa79543029642889059 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Varun-iiitb <var3907@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 24 Oct 2026 17:49:31 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 04/61] Add liveness debug page (debug builds only)

lib/ui/liveness/liveness_debug_page.dart, opened from a "Liveness test"
button on the login page that exists only when kDebugMode (the page also
renders nothing in other builds):
- workflow (RESIDENT / OPERATOR / SUPERVISOR), front or back camera, real or
  fake engine, and the fake scenario (config override
  mosip.registration.liveness.fake.scenario);
- "Force challenges": overrides
  mosip.registration.liveness.face.default.passiveThreshold to 0.9999;
- the policy and model version, the camera preview (AndroidView), Start /
  Retry / Cancel, a scrolling event log, and the result with the best-frame
  thumbnail.
It shows the passive score, which production screens never show. Not
localised on purpose (developer tool).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 lib/ui/liveness/liveness_debug_page.dart | 463 +++++++++++++++++++++++
 lib/ui/login_page.dart                   |  17 +
 2 files changed, 480 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 lib/ui/liveness/liveness_debug_page.dart

